At this point I almost had a YASD.  I had just engraved Elbereth with
my wand of fire, and was trying to get closer to another Ki-rin when I
noticed that my hitpoints were dropping fast (they were at 900).  A
closer look showed that I had been confused when trying to engrave, so
the Elbereth didn't come out right.  Worse, my Intelligence was at
14...  I immediately stopped ignoring the master mind flayer to the
south of me...  (I also lost another enchantment of the silver saber
somewhere).

Anyway.


Whacking and hacking....

I finally finished targeting all the archons and ki-rin I could see
(one advantage I had that was that create monster didn't work anymore
on this level , so only they could summon more monsters), and started
slaughtering xorns.  They didn't seem to be ending, and at one point I
stepped over a stack of 30 xorns corpses.  I was afraid that I had left
behind
some summoner, so I had the bright idea of removing the Eyes and
quaffing a potion of blindness (didn't have a towel along).



